  "description": "The shared library includes common classes used by Chant products in Windows applications to access the System.Speech and Microsoft.Speech speech recognition and speech synthesis engines.\n\nCommon classes are used across Chant products: GrammarKit, KinesicsKit, LexiconKit, ProfileKit, SpeechKit, VoiceMarkupKit, and VoiceXMLKit.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/developerworkbench for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
